WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
-One of the many things
that broke my heart

00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:02.869
about David Ortiz's retirement,
being a Red Sox fan,

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
is it was one
of my all-time favorite

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Weekend Update" characters
of yours.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.073 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. Thank you.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:09.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, for you to lose
a great sports impression --

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:12.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was so happy last Thursday
on the "Weekend Updates"

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:13.546 line:92%
to see you play LaVar Ball.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, thank God
for the world, you know.

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:16.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
The world just keeps...
-Yeah.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:17.951 align:start size:94% position:6%
The world gave you LaVar Ball.
There you are.

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:21.121
-...giving us these characters.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:23.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know?
-Yeah.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:23.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What can you say?
-Yeah.

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:26.626
-The guy, you know, he --
-And it's -- He's just --

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He loves his kids.
-He loves his kids.

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:30.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he's pure ego.
It's so funny.

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:31.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A thousand percent.
-Yeah.

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:33.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He has enough ego
for all 17 kids.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.536
-And what did -- what did he say
was in the shoes?

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:37.203 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-They're made out of

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
South African
"rhino-soceros" horn.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.174 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
Pure rhino-soceros.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:44.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The great thing
about watching it was,

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.312 line:92%
when you said "rhino-soceros,"

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
I immediately
wanted you to say it

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:48.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
like 10 more times
in the sketch.

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:50.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. For sure. I wish
we could have built it in.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:51.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I think
you came pretty close.

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:54.187
-I mean, I was lucky
for it to get on, in my opinion,

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:57.123
because they had such a great
lineup with the Trump boys

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then Bill calling in
and Leslie and all them, too.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.394
So I didn't really know if
it was going to make it or not.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.496
And then they told us, like,
"All the features are in."

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:04.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"Okay, I got to go kill this."

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:08.401
-So even 15 years in, you're
still backstage saying like,

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, am I gonna be
in the show or not?"

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:11.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I mean nothing.
-Yeah.

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:13.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean absolutely nothing.
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:15.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
15 years -- it doesn't matter,
because, like,

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:18.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's all about, you know,
a live show for that week --

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:19.345 size:78% position:39% line:92%
you know what I mean?

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:20.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you, at least now,
15 years in --

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:23.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
had it not been in,
would you have been crushed,

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:25.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
or would you have just said,
"Oh, that's okay"?

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, I was ready
for it not to be in.

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:28.555 line:92%
I was surprised that it went in.

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:30.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
We would have maybe tried it
the next week

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:31.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
or wait
till the show comes around.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:35.028
I mean, 568 shows today for you.
My God.

00:01:35.028 --> 00:01:36.329 size:81% position:41%
-Yeah. That's crazy.
-You know what I mean?

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:39.032
-Yeah, it's not that bad.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:41.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, I mean...
-Yeah.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"SNL" because, you know,
it is such a protected place,

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:46.372 size:88% position:44%
is very similar to that,
because we always know

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
there's another show coming,
another opportunity.

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:49.676 line:92%
-Yeah. And you have a sense

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
LaVar Ball
is gonna stay in the news.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think so.
-Yeah.

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:54.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I feel like
he likes it a little bit.

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:55.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Chuckling ] Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:57.217
-Well, that was the interesting
thing about Scaramucci

00:01:57.217 --> 00:01:59.919
was there was a one-week window
to do a Scaramucci.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:01.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ohh.
-And now it's already --

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:02.355 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I'm glad Bill did it,

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:05.125
but I don't think Bill's gonna
be dining out on Scaramucci.

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.192
-Yeah, it's not even fair, man.
-Yeah.

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:08.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was, like, you know,
a fillet left behind.

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:12.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. It was like he --
-8-ounce butterflied fillet.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sit there,
because I'm not feeling --

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:15.702 line:92%
I'm not feeling steak tonight.

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:16.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sir,
if you don't eat this soon,

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
there's gonna be flies
all over it.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:20.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It -- It's okay.
I'll just pay and leave it.

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.208 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.209 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's sad.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:23.810 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You went to --

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.479
Dave Chappelle's doing a series
of shows at Radio City.

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:28.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-And you went on Saturday,

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:30.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a lot of our --
our "SNL" friends were there.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, it was an --
it was an amazing night

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:36.689
because, number one, the homies
were, like, opening for him.

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:38.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-So Pete went out first.

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.225 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Pete Davidson.
-He crushed it. Yeah.

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:41.628
And then Colin went out --
Colin Jost -- for everyone.

00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:43.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]
And he did his thing.

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:45.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then Che went out --
Michael Che...

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:46.232 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ] Yeah.

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.500
-...like a -- like a rock star,
because, you know,

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.069
he's New York, home grown, so
they -- they really gave it up.

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:53.206
And then Leslie came out and
just, like, tore the roof off.

00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:54.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. There are no --
-And...

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Leslie is currently leaving
no roofs on buildings.

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:57.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Yeah.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was just --
It was just funny

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:03.883
to hear the people around me,
like, "Yes! Work, Leslie, work!"

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:05.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
It was like, "Oh, yeah.

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
We see
who's in the house tonight."

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:10.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then they reset for like
15 minutes or 20 minutes.

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:12.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you're -- you're thinking
that it's just like

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:15.995 align:start size:94% position:6%
the typical comedy show
or comedy evening or whatever.

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:17.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then Dave Chappelle
just came out

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.365 line:92%
like a freaking rock star.

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:20.066 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Wow. That's amazing.

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:22.602
-Like, from out of the floor,
like, the smoke, the lights,

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:24.938
the old-school, like, arch
of lights and all of that.

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:25.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Have you ever
come out of a floor?

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:27.674
I'm realizing
I've never come out of a floor.

00:03:27.674 --> 00:03:28.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's --
You know, my own personal,

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:30.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
but nobody's been there
to watch.

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.212 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.212 --> 00:03:33.046 line:92%
I actually do it every morning.

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:36.616
That's how I get up, and I
present myself to my house.

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:38.251 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:40.253 line:92%
But he just came out like a star

00:03:40.253 --> 00:03:41.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then immediately started,
like,

00:03:41.955 --> 00:03:43.623 align:start size:94% position:6%
tearing Trump's butthole out.
-Yeah.

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:44.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-It was -- It was awesome.

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:46.593
-Well, he's -- it's been
interesting to read about it...

00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:48.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was awesome.
-...because...

00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:49.062
-It was that -- It was that day.
-Yeah.

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:51.831
-It was that day that all that
Charlotte stuff was going on.

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:55.168
And then, you know, of course
he felt, like, the burden --

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:57.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
because when he was on "SNL"
and he hosted last,

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:59.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, it was right after
Trump got elected.

00:03:59.405 --> 00:03:59.973 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, that week.

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:01.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like,
"America, give him a chance."

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:03.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he was, like,
"Man, 'f' that!"

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:04.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:04:04.377 --> 00:04:05.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was like,
"Yeah, man, I feel you."

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:06.646 line:92%
It's -- It's crazy times.

00:04:06.646 --> 00:04:08.047 size:78% position:39%
-Well, I'm so excited
for next Thursday.

00:04:08.047 --> 00:04:09.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm so excited
for the season premiere.

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:10.149 line:92%
-Yeah, man, it's going down.

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:11.951
-And such a pleasure to have you
here, as always, buddy.

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:14.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you, as usual.
-Kenan Thompson, everybody.

